OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tip blocks road and prompts
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe dumping of a heap of household
OL,7,Fwaste on a narrow country road has
OL,8,Fprompted an investigation by a local
OL,9,Fauthority.
OL,11,FOn Saturday, photos showed a large pile
OL,12,Fof rubbish, including armchairs,
OL,13,Fblocking Honeypot Lane in Stow Maries,
OL,14,FEssex.
OL,16,FMaldon District Council contractors
OL,17,Fcleared the obstruction soon after and,
OL,18,Fon Monday, it called for eyewitnesses
OL,19,For any footage that could aid its
OL,20,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
