OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tip blocks road and prompts
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt asked members of the public to stay
OL,7,Fvigilant and issued a guide to help
OL,8,Fspot unlicensed waste collectors and
OL,9,Fwarned that households could be fined
OL,10,Fif waste from their property was found
OL,11,Ffly-tipped.
